{
  "source_poem_zh": "执手相看泪眼，竟无语凝噎。\n念去去、千里烟波，暮霭沉沉楚天阔。",
  "critical_units": [
    {
      "id": "song_03_u1",
      "source_span": "执手相看泪眼",
      "meaning": "以相握的手和泪眼呈现临别双方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_03_u2",
      "source_span": "竟无语凝噎",
      "meaning": "情绪使言语受阻，具体发话者未逐一标明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_03_u3",
      "source_span": "念去去、千里烟波",
      "meaning": "由当前分别转向想象远行的漫长水路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "song_03_u4",
      "source_span": "暮霭沉沉楚天阔",
      "meaning": "暮霭和辽阔天空共同营造远阔、低沉的景象。"
    }
  ],
  "translations_to_score": [
    {
      "opaque_id": "x763713a63fe6d0",
      "translation": "Clasping hands, we gaze into tear-filled eyes,\nMute, our throats choked with sobs.\nI think of the road stretching on and on—\nA thousand miles of misty waters,\nThe evening haze sinking deep beneath the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x063da59c81bf9a",
      "translation": "Holding hands, we gaze into each other’s tear-filled eyes,\nChoked with sobs, unable to speak.\nI think of going, farther and farther—\nA thousand miles of mist-veiled waters,\nEvening haze hanging heavy beneath Chu’s vast sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x16559bcef6cacc",
      "translation": "Hand clasped in hand, we gaze through tears,\nchoked into silence—not a word.\nI think of going, farther, farther:\na thousand miles of mist-veiled waves,\nthe dusk-mists deep and heavy,\nthe skies of Chu so vast.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x8ec7181249806a",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze through tear-filled eyes,\nyet neither can speak, choked with grief.\nI think of the long road ahead—miles of mist-veiled waters;\ndusk settles heavy beneath the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x206ea39f9ef54d",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze through tears—\nno words, our throats choked tight.\nI think of the miles ahead: mist over a thousand li;\nat dusk, heavy clouds, and the vastness of the Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "xc0abf849125743",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we meet each other’s tearful eyes—\nthen words fail, and grief closes the throat.\nI think of the miles ahead: waves of mist,\ndusk deepening, the vast Chu sky stretching wide.",
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}

