    {
      "opaque_id": "x8023de8d2dc644",
      "translation": "Holding hands, we gaze into each other’s tearful eyes,\nchoked with sobs, unable to speak.\nI think of going—farther, farther—\na thousand miles of mist and waves,\nevening haze hanging heavy,\nthe skies of Chu stretching wide.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x1694caf9431e01",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze through tear-blurred eyes;  \nspeech fails, and we choke on silence.  \nI think of the road stretching on and on—  \na thousand miles of misty waters;  \nheavy dusk spreads beneath the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x46bf8b84552ade",
      "translation": "Holding hands, we gaze into tear-filled eyes—\nNo words can pass our choked throats.\nI think of the road ahead, ahead:\nA thousand miles of misty waters,\nDusk haze sinking heavily beneath\nThe vast, far-reaching Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x106728bd7bf2f2",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze at each other through tear-blurred eyes; not a word can pass our choked throats.\nI think of the long journey ahead: a thousand miles of mist-veiled waters, dusk haze heavy beneath the vast southern sky.",
      "notes": [
        "“Chu” refers to the ancient southern region of China."
      ]
    },
    {
      "opaque_id": "x8a1bddd4c5b137",
      "translation": "Hand in hand, we gaze through tear-filled eyes,\nSpeechless, choked with grief.\nI think of the miles ahead, veiled in misty waves;\nAt dusk, dense clouds darken the vast Chu sky.",
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}

